sequenceDiagram
    actor R as Requester
    participant App as Browser app
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant Order as Order Service
    participant Others as Supplier, Rating, Credit

    R->>App: /requests/new
    par form data
        App->>GW: GET /api/v1/supplier?pageSize=100
        App->>GW: GET /api/v1/orders/delivery-points
        App->>GW: GET /api/v1/orders/delivery-points/my-locations
        App->>GW: GET /api/v1/credit/me/balance
    end
    R->>App: item, reward, pickup, dropoff, times
    Note over App: checks the reward against the shown balance before sending
    App->>GW: POST /api/v1/orders
    GW->>Order: authorize, set X-User-Id, forward
    Order->>Others: supplier lookup, rating snapshot, reserve credits
    alt reserved and stored
        Order-->>App: 201 order, status Created
        App->>GW: GET /api/v1/credit/me/balance
        App-->>R: /orders/{id}
    else not enough credits, or a service is down
        Order-->>App: 400 or 503 with { error, code }
        App-->>R: error shown on the form, nothing posted
    end
